## Layout (a standalone package under `packages/addons/{{kebabCase name}}/`)

| Layer | File | Holds |
|---|---|---|
| schema | `src/schema/index.ts` | Drizzle `pgTable`s + row types (`$inferSelect`). Every table carries `tenantId`. |
| schemas | `src/schemas/index.ts` | re-exports from the contract slice; add-on-local Zod only |
| service | `src/service/{{kebabCase name}}.service.ts` | ALL business logic; emits events after DB commit; money in `db.transaction` |
| router | `src/router/index.ts` | thin oRPC wiring: resolve caller, call service, `mapErrors` |
| plugin | `src/plugin.ts` | DI wiring only: `ctx.routers.add(...)`, `ctx.provide(...)` |

This is a CORE add-on: its contract slice lives in `packages/contracts/orpc-contract/src/{{kebabCase name}}.ts`
(the source of truth for shapes) and its migrations are generated centrally from
`packages/platform/db` (the scaffolder adds the schema glob there). The router does
`implement(contract.{{camelCase name}})`. Registered with NO `kind` in `extensions.config.ts`,
so it always loads.

## Extension points

### Ports (adapter interfaces)
