(`packages/contracts/adapters/src/<category>.ts`) via `createToken<T>('NAME')`, implement it
under `src/adapters/<vendor>/`, and bind it in `plugin.ts` with
`ctx.provide(TOKEN, () => new Impl())`. Services depend on the port, never on the container.

